## Open questions
Primary human Schwann seed-specific/ERN1-RNase-specific crossed perturbation with nascent RNA and multi-timepoint pulse-chase; quantify input versus AGO-loaded miR29 and control growth/state. Prespecified falsifier: adequate-precision unchanged survival with reduced nascent output rejects increased decay as sufficient for the tested RNA loss. Stronger rodent or human evidence does not identify that decomposition in the audited studies. No new wet-lab experiment performed.

